Package: nepalallometry
Type: Package
Title: Allometric Estimation for Nepal's Forest Trees
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Santosh", "Ayer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ayer.sant@gmail.com")
Author: Santosh Ayer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Santosh Ayer <ayer.sant@gmail.com>
Description: Implements published allometric methods for estimating tree
    biomass and carbon in Nepal. The first stable release implements equations
    and procedures from the Forest Research and Training Centre (2025),
    Sharma and Pukkala (1990), and Chave et al. (2014). It provides tree-,
    plot-, species-, diameter-class-, and forest-level biomass and carbon
    summaries, together with information on species coverage and calculation
    methods.
